SCENARIO: 1. stzNumber.ToScientificNotationForm: the exact texts
  GIVEN numbers of every shape
  THEN  1500 is 1.5e+03  [PASS]
  THEN  255 is 2.55e+02  [PASS]
  THEN  1 is 1e+00, with no point  [PASS]
  THEN  10 is 1e+01  [PASS]
  THEN  100 is 1e+02: the trailing zeros are gone  [PASS]
  THEN  1000000 is 1e+06  [PASS]
  THEN  123456 is 1.23456e+05  [PASS]
  THEN  3735928559 is 3.735928559e+09  [PASS]
  THEN  0 is 0e+00  [PASS]
  THEN  5.75 is 5.75e+00  [PASS]
  THEN  0.1 is 1e-01: the exponent sign is written for a small number  [PASS]
  THEN  0.00123 is 1.23e-03  [PASS]
  THEN  0.000001 is 1e-06  [PASS]
  THEN  -2.5 is -2.5e+00  [PASS]
  THEN  -1500 is -1.5e+03: the sign leads  [PASS]
  THEN  -0.00123 is -1.23e-03  [PASS]
  THEN  99.5 is 9.95e+01: no rounding of a digit that is there  [PASS]
  THEN  9.9999 is 9.9999e+00  [PASS]
  THEN  1/3 keeps its 16 digits: 3.333333333333333e-01  [PASS]
  THEN  123456789.123456789 keeps its 17 digits: 1.2345678912345679e+08  [PASS]
  THEN  NEGATIVE: the letter is lower case, never E  [PASS]
  THEN  NEGATIVE: a positive exponent keeps its sign, never 1.5e03  [PASS]
  THEN  NEGATIVE: an exponent keeps two digits, never 1.5e+3  [PASS]
  THEN  NEGATIVE: no trailing zero in the mantissa, never 1.50e+03  [PASS]
  -> 24 pass, 0 fail

